ima sugu torimodoshi ni ikanakya

62
00:02:33,130 --> 00:02:38,720
"Hemen geri dönmeliyim!"

63
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:40,260
baka darou?

64
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:40,260
Aptalım, değil mi?

65
00:02:40,260 --> 00:02:41,470
ai

66
00:02:40,260 --> 00:02:41,470
Aşk!

67
